1
00:00:00,764 --> 00:00:01,934
(Leonard:)How am I the bad guy?

2
00:00:02,099 --> 00:00:04,709
(Leonard:)She's the one who married
someone else. I'm the victim.

3
00:00:04,868 --> 00:00:07,908
(Howard:)Sounds like Zack's the victim.
You're sleeping with his wife.

4
00:00:10,574 --> 00:00:13,554
(Mike:)I've kept my marriage
together for 35 years.

5
00:00:13,711 --> 00:00:15,051
(Mike:)Can I weigh in here?

6
00:00:15,212 --> 00:00:16,152
(Amy:)Sure.

7
00:00:16,313 --> 00:00:18,383
(Mike:)I'm trying to watch the game.
Shut up.

8
00:00:21,819 --> 00:00:24,269
(Mike:)How do you not make
a first down there?

9
00:00:24,421 --> 00:00:25,991
(Sheldon:)They passed against
a nickel defense.

10
00:00:26,156 --> 00:00:27,966
(Sheldon:)They should have run it off-tackle.

11
00:00:30,661 --> 00:00:32,441
(Mike:)How the hell
do you know that?

12
00:00:32,596 --> 00:00:34,076
(Sheldon:)My father loved football.

13
00:00:34,231 --> 00:00:35,801
(Sheldon:)He always made me watch it

14
00:00:35,966 --> 00:00:37,566
(Sheldon:)before I was allowed
to do my homework.

15
00:00:37,735 --> 00:00:39,405
(Howard:)Well...

16
00:00:39,603 --> 00:00:41,103
(Penny:)You'll be happy to know
I just spoke to Zack

17
00:00:41,271 --> 00:00:42,771
(Penny:)and he's willing to
sign the court papers.

18
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,110
(Penny:)He's on his way here now.

19
00:00:44,274 --> 00:00:46,944
(Leonard:)-Wait, you invited him here?
-Yeah.

20
00:00:47,111 --> 00:00:48,781
(Mike:)I'm getting ready
to weigh in again.

21
00:00:48,946 --> 00:00:50,086
(Howard:)Come on.

22
00:00:51,515 --> 00:00:54,155
(Penny:)What do you think
they ought to do now?

23
00:00:54,318 --> 00:00:56,458
(Sheldon:)I would throw a quick slant
to a wide-out,

24
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:59,020
given that the defense
is showing blitz.

